{"title":"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/8/8a86702dc60b9db916798b1115a6b6822bf828b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[t]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" /> denote the greatest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/e/ffec49e71c7feb7a098a66c448654ccc4eed571e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\leq t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/1/bf13bc28bdcfc0124fab1bf4ca959289e15f374d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/9/519a9cb046a02347dbb029af54b31e7a5467e35f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\{(x,y): (x-T)^2 + y^2 \\leq T^2 \\text{ where } T = t - [t]\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"398\" height=\"20\" />. Then we have \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/d/cfdaf8d99c599dca435c68cd94e54269003f8904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{the point } (0,0) \\text{ does not belong to } S \\text{ for any } t \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/9/2c9ec9785fd64a0dbbfb8a0094c81eddabc0d98a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0 \\leq \\text{Area } S \\leq \\pi \\text{ for all } t \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"215\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26ff22870cd8c6cae02ced4286ca62d298163a95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}\\ S \\text{ is contained in the first quadrant for all } t \\geq 5 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"385\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/6600578e063b2f03fd3dedc17d47eb7465856fe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{the center of } S \\text{ for any } t \\text{ is on the line } y=x \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"362\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/c/aac58afda0e28e38ab6e83222006e339ed8278f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of the other statements is true}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"295\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The region <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is a circle radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/0/6d0c27110ddf7469f531d998f5baa0d83b933688.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(T,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"18\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/7/2470029d2f8a41a183d4241e9bef67ede773f332.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T = t-[t]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/f/baf9202b805ecb527365eca72e588aa6b7ab4a6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le T &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />.  That means the area of the circle is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" />, and since the region can also be just a dot (achieved when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> is integer), the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME\" title=\"1973 AHSME\">1973 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1973 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1973\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=